{
  "name": "NS 02 · Scheduled routines (hourly, daily & monthly)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Scheduled routines\nEach trigger asks the backend to run one routine. Runs are deduplicated by their scheduled hour, day or month. Attendance checks run hourly at :15, evaluate each employee's shift, and remind each employee at most once per day.\n\nTimes are India time (workflow timezone Asia/Kolkata). Keep trigger times aligned with server/core/routines.js.\n\nSet `ROUTINES_MODE=n8n` in the backend `.env` once this workflow is published. If n8n misses a run, the backend runs it after the configured fallback delay and tells you.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5eed767a-11f0-53d5-a5e1-b7fc09e64cb2",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "30 8 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
